   "Consonne + y : y devient ied (study → studied).",
   "Verbes irréguliers : une forme à apprendre (go → went, see → saw).",
   "Négation : did not (didn't) + infinitif : I didn't go.",
   "Question : Did + sujet + infinitif : Did you see him ?",
   "Mots-clés : yesterday, last week, two years ago, in 2020."
