 {
  "id": "g-comparatives",
  "level": "A2",
  "title_fr": "Comparatif et superlatif",
  "rule_fr": [
   "Adjectif court (1 syllabe) : comparatif en -er + than (taller than), superlatif the + -est (the tallest).",
   "Adjectif long (2 syllabes ou plus) : more + adjectif + than ; the most + adjectif.",
   "Irréguliers : good → better → the best ; bad → worse → the worst ; far → further → the furthest.",
   "Égalité : as + adjectif + as : as tall as."
  ],
  "formula": [
